oQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"oo88TE2jCxYfIen_oWFjdA","review_id":"Ho_12UC4BIs_JD7CkC6ilg","date":"2017-12-27T00:27:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9292911887168884,"text_excerpt":"I've been visiting Shank for over a year and his food is always awesome. A friend ordered his steak and eggs dish and commented on all the food. Chris said, you don't get tourist portions here! Great food with a lot of originality. His meatballs are some of the best I've ever had (I often pick them up and serve them at home). His Thai chicken is worth the 15 minutes of wait time. Brined and cooked to perfection. Chris has a unique meat counter and sells a lot of aged meats. Homemade sausage, as well. The only thing missing on his menu is ICED tea! Do yourself a favor and try it out. You won't be disappointed."},{"business_id":"oo88TE2jCxYfIen_oWFjdA","review_id":"f9f0px_n7XHrARICMBxnaw","date":"2016-10-09T00:35:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9261571764945984,"text_excerpt":"I started coming here to get the delicious bacon, sausage and chicken broth--all of which are among the best in town. Ate dinner here tonight and, even though my expectations were high, I was blown away by the quality of the food, especially considering the very reasonable prices. The pork sliders were, as others have said, the best I've had; tender yet crispy and covered with just the right amount of sauce. The ambiance is low key and relaxed, and the service super friendly. Even my dog loves this place;; they have meaty dog bones to go!"},{"business_id":"oo88TE2jCxYfIen_oWFjdA","review_id":"GQnaRJdy6Dfe5Cnb-YMgDA","date":"2020-02-02T21:47:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9149637222290039,"text_excerpt":"If you do nothing else in the Marigny, visit Shank! Chris is extremely knowledgeable and is simply a master of meat. His menu of the day is fresh and sparked with ideas from the food he likes to eat so you know it's good!! Do not overlook this neighborhood gem!!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"oo88TE2jCxYfIen_oWFjdA","photo_id":"Av3gFbDGUybahQm-4CCYWQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Av3gFbDGUybahQm-4CCYWQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
